<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-20T07:48:38.457Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:48:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces arrested two Syrian men after an incursion into Jubata al-Khashab in Quneitra, while Damascus courts continued trials of three defendants in transitional justice cases. In the north, a former Hurras al-Din commander was arrested in Idlib and the Syrian Kurdish community expressed a preference for Bashar al-Assad over Erdogan. The Syrian defense universities limited women’s admission to most programs, and the YPJ reiterated its role as a security guarantee amid an integration process. Damascus and Syrian officials warned that Druze groups, allegedly backed by Israel, may launch an offensive in Sweida. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5PM0tsdE1VRV9GU25CcHpENlotRE1RSmNwSkc3VGFhbmxkUV9iWDY1T1Y5RGlKU3NMQ3JIcGNROWVGckJaSU9xdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOajUxRndDSFlqTGNiTXE4Sm5lYjVuTkIxZEdRRkJYbmtOOXNzMHprTzlyYndPY1lNYzBYRm9Od2hBenN1VWxtclRjQmplVF8tbnlBM0oyVUxac1RmeWhQUE0zbG10MUVCd1JVckJ1VXZDVEt1NXZMdzlaSldueFNCU0FNZnU5YU5HWUhrcTJ5cXlxUnVTLWxZSWRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPZjhhQW9lUXB3b2hoNVhsUVdXMENCTkFKUzcwb2R6UDJjbmtBcUNTUzhFSWtvTFIwaXAwb01ubkFvY0F3a2JiZXJLX1dVT2MtcjdWS1ZVcV9qUEs2bmNMV210Y0UtbWVuVzNpYXRIWG90SXdoWkRjenRyc0FFTVlWenV6TUlHVnl1WV9vQkRXYWM0TTFDSXdUcDhYSnpqOFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQUlk4SmdZNEtNelUwZjJoajVZMy0yME5VZDBPQTg4bTZyeXJmVElVRG1rV1VJS3h5UkF2QjZtRWhVRnhHS19jSEVwZnFOaDZHbURHd052a215YzRjZGNRT0I2VWFGNE5Mc3VmT2NBLU9rOVdidEZqdmhXaGlMUGpDaFpMeWhCdVZ1LXhHeGQ3NEQ0dw?oc